# The Dapr control plane (operator, sentry, placement, scheduler, sidecar injector): a prerequisite a platform runs
# once per cluster in dapr-system (ADR 0153). rask's chart renders its own Components, Configurations and Resiliency
# against it and names its namespace in `dapr.controlPlaneNamespace`. Its CRDs ship in the chart's crds/ directory,
# so no release owns them and no upgrade or uninstall deletes them.
RELEASE=dapr
NAMESPACE=dapr-system
REPO=https://dapr.github.io/helm-charts/
CHART=dapr
# A release candidate on purpose: 1.19 is the first Dapr whose Vault secret store logs in with Kubernetes auth
# (components-contrib#4448), which each sidecar's own store login needs ([[XC-165]]). Re-pin to 1.19's GA release.
VERSION=1.19.0-rc.4
